# Potential Persistence Via Microsoft Office Add-In | T1137.006 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/file/file_event/file_event_win_office_addin_persistence.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=11 ((TargetFilename="*\\Microsoft\\Word\\Startup\\*" TargetFilename="*.wll") OR (TargetFilename="*\\Microsoft\\Excel\\Startup\\*" TargetFilename="*.xll") OR (TargetFilename="*Microsoft\\Excel\\XLSTART\\*" TargetFilename="*.xlam") OR (TargetFilename="*\\Microsoft\\Addins\\*" (TargetFilename IN ("*.xlam", "*.xla", "*.ppam"))))
